Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:06.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:17.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.50,0:00:22.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:26.23,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.01,0:00:33.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.32,0:00:40.18,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.66,0:00:48.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.26,0:00:54.33,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.44,0:00:58.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.17,0:01:02.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.18,0:01:09.32,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:20.75,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:53.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不能常常回去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:58.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女孩子嘛 总是会有很多东西要买
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 给你 （洋芋片）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.26,0:02:01.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是干地瓜呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给七宝的是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.76,0:02:06.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.60,0:02:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.10,0:02:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 它还会自己转耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.07,0:02:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不胜感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.31,0:02:21.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本想特别来和她会合的说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.45,0:02:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得有机会回到故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:32.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是修理飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.89,0:02:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该还有很多事情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.29,0:02:37.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也许不回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:40.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为有个老爱摸屁股的色鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.83,0:02:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是这样子的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.50,0:02:44.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.64,0:02:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想应该不需要担心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.47,0:02:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第59话 美少女姐妹花拜师学艺
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.30,0:03:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然无法像父亲一样技术那么好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言 算是很不错了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:18.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 还有大家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.43,0:04:20.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于都回到故乡了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.23,0:04:24.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直让你们这么孤单
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.61,0:04:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能胜任驱魔师的工作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好像很适合继承家业的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.82,0:04:48.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.96,0:04:53.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止接受的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了让你继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.20,0:05:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也希望你能坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.14,0:05:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您那时是想要说什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.67,0:05:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.67,0:05:38.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你原谅芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:40.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.75,0:05:54.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.16,0:05:59.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.46,0:06:03.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经三天没吃没喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.68,0:06:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真好吃呢 芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.28,0:06:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有呢 你们要吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:22.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一碗！ 再来一碗！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是姐姐芹菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.72,0:06:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妹妹铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.69,0:06:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开家乡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.99,0:06:34.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只靠着传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:37.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找寻驱魔师隐密的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:40.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我是驱魔师
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会袭击我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.74,0:06:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是想试试你的身手而已
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:45.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是了得呢 大姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.64,0:06:50.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请收我们为徒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.25,0:06:52.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收你们？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们身手很不错喔 大姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,师父 请您一定要收我们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.82,0:06:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.02,0:07:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通融一下嘛 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.46,0:07:03.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.39,0:07:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托您 师父
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.33,0:07:10.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.23,0:07:13.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还有急事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:17.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非您收我们当徒弟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教导我们驱魔的功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我们回不了故乡的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.98,0:07:22.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.75,0:07:31.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们似乎有什么隐情呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.49,0:07:34.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的村子是靠着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.06,0:07:38.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在山坡上开垦而维持生活
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.86,0:07:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了稍微扩大田地
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.20,0:07:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而开垦镇守之森的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.63,0:07:46.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却从此让妖怪们横行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还不只一两只而已
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经有好几个村民牺牲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:07:55.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能逃到其他地方的人还好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是家里有老人与小孩的人却没有办法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.15,0:08:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都过着不安的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,镇守之森有布下结界吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.52,0:08:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得到有个驱魔师村的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.33,0:08:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如你们所见
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.83,0:08:15.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师村已经不存在了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:22.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么就让我去如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.97,0:08:27.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子里没有能支付给珊瑚姐姐的礼物或钱
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.61,0:08:28.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:32.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不打算雇用驱魔师的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:34.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且村子很远呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:37.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算赶走妖怪一两次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.69,0:08:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们还是会再来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.19,0:08:42.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与其那样不如训练我们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.06,0:08:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会为了大家而努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.69,0:08:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.20,0:08:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是一朝一夕能学会的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 如果只是赶走小妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.67,0:09:00.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许可以教你们一些
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.71,0:09:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是晚个一两天出发
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.35,0:09:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家应该会等我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:18.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先给你们驱魔的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.46,0:09:19.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:35.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这附近试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:43.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要光看 快点扇
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.00,0:09:55.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混合妖怪讨厌的药草与矿物的粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.73,0:10:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么做就能驱魔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.87,0:10:05.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保护你们村子的话很够了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.25,0:10:14.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些烟确实很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过真的可以驱魔吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.66,0:10:23.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大姐姐 不 师父！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.29,0:10:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有更华丽的招式吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:29.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只学个一招半式反而更危险
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.90,0:10:31.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天很晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:34.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天再教你们怎么制作这些粉末
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.17,0:10:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚还没有回来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.05,0:10:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 有件事想请教一下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:50.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人会因为被摸臀部
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.05,0:10:54.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就背叛了彼此的信赖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.93,0:10:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,互相保持应有的距离
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是一种信赖不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:02.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样子的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.03,0:11:06.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚没回来果然都是你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一定会回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.21,0:11:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然嘴巴说一定
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却一点都冷静不下来呢 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.73,0:11:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.24,0:11:48.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.28,0:11:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,潜入的技术我可是不输人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.11,0:11:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就看你的了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:11:59.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.35,0:12:02.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然 父亲说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.26,0:12:03.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔师武器的秘密
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这些材料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.76,0:12:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,材料
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.13,0:12:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪们的牙齿 骨头与皮革
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:13.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们才能对付强悍的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说只要有这些
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.27,0:12:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也能够…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.01,0:12:18.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定会变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.51,0:12:26.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…芹菜姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:28.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:32.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不是一般的小女孩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.40,0:12:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种身手…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:44.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.17,0:12:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是个忍者村
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.27,0:12:53.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.44,0:12:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从城里接到了一个不熟悉的驱魔任务
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然以忍术好不容易打倒妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.32,0:13:07.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到那些妖怪的同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.42,0:13:09.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了报仇而袭击村子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.46,0:13:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会用忍术的大家
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.70,0:13:15.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几乎都成了妖怪的食物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:34.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐 已经没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.62,0:13:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.62,0:13:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作一点 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们 也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:14:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.71,0:14:03.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸这么说完之后就死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.38,0:14:05.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要坚强…要变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.15,0:14:08.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让村子再度恢复往日的光景
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.72,0:14:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲一定是想这么说的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.12,0:14:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.90,0:14:29.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然没错
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:34.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们连尚未去除妖气的武器都带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散发妖气的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.24,0:14:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会招来大批妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,云母
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:48.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.52,0:14:49.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那两人有危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等我 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:15:00.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 姐姐老是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:02.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个我来拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.41,0:15:05.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也难怪爸爸会期待
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由妹妹我来继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.08,0:15:14.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要持续修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.32,0:15:17.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定也能成为像父亲所说
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,强悍的忍者
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:26.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.34,0:15:38.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.11,0:15:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个 快坐上云母的背
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到村子里去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会还给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.65,0:15:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些东西快丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.72,0:15:55.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大群妖怪正朝着散发妖气的武器过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的！快点！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:31.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.97,0:16:36.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好打倒妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:37.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,争取逃走的时间了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.17,0:16:39.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:42.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是让父亲见识我们的力量的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.87,0:16:43.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.74,0:16:46.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们毕竟是忍者村的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有能够除掉妖怪的武器
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.42,0:16:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:58.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到目前为止接受的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:03.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了让你继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.53,0:17:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也希望你能坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.83,0:17:12.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等！不是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.07,0:17:16.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们父亲所说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不是为了让你们这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.14,0:17:20.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你懂什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:25.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有父亲不希望女儿们过的幸福的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.58,0:17:29.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是希望你们继承衣钵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.82,0:17:32.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是希望你们坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.33,0:17:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过着幸福的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.06,0:17:38.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:42.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 坐上云母
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.13,0:17:45.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧的跟在我后面
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.08,0:17:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜 铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.68,0:17:59.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算只剩你们 也要坚强的…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.09,0:18:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并得到幸福 才是他期盼的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.70,0:18:14.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.17,0:18:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么！芹菜姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.70,0:18:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚姐姐说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.94,0:18:24.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:31.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.05,0:18:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走咯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.99,0:18:45.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们不要出手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.76,0:19:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铃菜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.23,0:19:25.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,芹菜姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种家伙也费这么大劲
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.65,0:20:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是一点都不像你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:20.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后面让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风穴
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.68,0:20:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们来接你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.12,0:20:50.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:09.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 芹菜姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个要坚强的活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.42,0:21:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为弥勒这家伙一直在担心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了之后果然不出所料
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.12,0:21:30.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 幸好赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.63,0:21:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.86,0:21:39.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的这么担心我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.60,0:21:43.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是所谓的预感吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.17,0:21:45.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 因为你的身影
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.34,0:21:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直在我眼前浮现 挥之不去的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.45,0:22:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪里 哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.69,0:22:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作点啊 弥勒一族
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:06.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想变成那种大人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.38,0:22:29.15,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.85,0:22:40.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.07,0:22:48.23,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:51.83,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:56.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.88,0:23:03.25,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.49,0:23:10.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:18.43,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.34,0:23:26.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.81,0:23:34.01,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.07,0:23:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.90,0:23:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那家伙竟然带着以前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.30,0:23:52.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和桔梗对决过的邪恶巫女来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.64,0:23:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惨了 完全都看不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.14,0:23:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟不上进度了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.34,0:23:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙利用四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.88,0:23:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要对你施放可怕的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.11,0:24:00.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都叫我和犬夜叉分手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:01.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我把话说完
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.08,0:24:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.65,0:24:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人都说你是暴力劈腿吃醋男
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.75,0:24:07.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？那是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.85,0:24:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.16,0:24:10.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑巫女 五十年的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.16,0:24:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.39,0:24:13.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么意思啦？
